#: src/ui/layout.md:357
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const titleBar = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Back\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Text(\"Page Title\"),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"Settings\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

