#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:159
msgid ""
"CPU baseline for the generated machine code: an LLVM CPU name "
"(`\"x86-64-v2\"`, `\"x86-64-v3\"`, `\"znver2\"`, `\"apple-m1\"`, …), "
"`\"native\"` (tune to the build machine's full instruction set), or "
"`\"generic\"` (the target architecture's portable baseline). Pin this when "
"the binary runs on machines other than the build box — an unpinned "
"host-native build on an AVX-512 machine crashes with SIGILL on older x86-64 "
"CPUs. Equivalent to `--march` / `PERRY_TARGET_CPU`."
msgstr ""

